BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Music for Good Series: Don't Look Now
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T163000
UID:e1d46edf79e2e6e83e87dbee1dcfeff2@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Screenshot%202026-07-02%20at%2010.20.26%E2%80%AFAM_2026070217
 2218189771.png
DESCRIPTION:States Win Sonoma County is offering a series of musical event
 s to raise money for democratic candidates in state elections and build a 
 better future for all of us. You can attend one or all of the events. On S
 unday\, August 2nd\, is an afternoon house concert featuring "Don't Look N
 ow\," a high energy Americana string band. Please donate $25-$50 per perso
 n to confirm your registration at this link: https://bit.ly/Kang_MusicAug 
 "Don't Look Now" is a new configuration of friends who have been playin
LOCATION:Santa Rosa\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/stateswinsonomacounty/event/951261/
