 n!) and join us on the sidewalk for our first of many visibility events be
 tween now and November using the theme “Voting is Your Superpower”. On
 ly signs encouraging voter participation\, please. Some suggested slogans:
  “Voting is Your Superpower”\, “Your Vote is Your Voice”\, “Vote
 ”\, “Your Vot
